        "folderId": "24",
        "color": "#6042a6",
        "latex": "R_{andom}=\\ a_{1}\\ \\to\\ M\\left(\\operatorname{random}\\left(\\right)-0.5\\right),\\ a_{2}\\ \\to\\ M\\left(\\operatorname{random}\\left(\\right)-0.5\\right),\\ a_{3}\\to\\ M\\left(\\operatorname{random}\\left(\\right)-0.5\\right),\\ b_{1}\\ \\to\\ \\ M\\left(\\operatorname{random}\\left(\\right)-0.5\\right),\\ b_{2}\\ \\to\\ M\\left(\\operatorname{random}\\left(\\right)-0.5\\right),\\ b_{3}\\to\\ M\\left(\\operatorname{random}\\left(\\right)-0.5\\right),\\ c_{1}\\ \\to\\ \\ M\\left(\\operatorname{random}\\left(\\right)-0.5\\right),\\ c_{2}\\ \\to\\ M\\left(\\operatorname{random}\\left(\\right)-0.5\\right),\\ c_{3}\\to\\ M\\left(\\operatorname{random}\\left(\\right)-0.5\\right),\\ d_{1}\\ \\to\\ \\ M\\left(\\operatorname{random}\\left(\\right)-0.5\\right),d_{2}\\ \\to\\ M\\left(\\operatorname{random}\\left(\\right)-0.5\\right),\\ d_{3}\\to\\ M\\left(\\operatorname{random}\\left(\\right)-0.5\\right)"
